e fallback for validated A1 target collocation: is the first room"}]},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing"}')
